<view class="page settings-page"><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="local-banner">本地演练 · 这里的操作只影响演练角色</view><view class="eyebrow">安心记录每一次相聚</view><view class="title">隐私与数据</view><view class="card"><view class="privacy-head" bindtap="togglePrivacy"><view class="flex"><view class="dish-name">你的数据，由你做主</view><view class="muted">私有厨房、最少公开、随时导出</view></view><text class="chevron">{{privacyExpanded?'⌃':'⌄'}}</text></view><view wx:if="{{privacyExpanded}}" class="paragraph">{{privacy}}</view><view wx:if="{{local}}" class="muted privacy-demo">演练数据留在本机，图片审核与消息提醒均为模拟。</view></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">留一份自己的备份</view><view class="muted">导出当前有权查看的数据。若你是接单厨师，文件也可能包含内部参考金额，请妥善保管。</view><button class="primary" bindtap="exportData" loading="{{busy}}" disabled="{{busy}}">导出我的数据</button><block wx:if="{{exportText}}"><view class="export-ready">备份文件已准备好</view><button class="secondary" bindtap="shareExport">保存或发送备份文件</button><button class="link-button" bindtap="copy">复制完整数据文本</button><scroll-view scroll-y class="export"><text selectable>{{exportText}}</text></scroll-view></block></view><view class="card"><view class="section-title">和我们说说</view><textarea class="textarea" value="{{feedback}}" bindinput="feedbackInput" maxlength="500" placeholder="哪里不顺手？下次想多做点什么？请不要填写密码或联系方式。"/><button class="secondary" disabled="{{busy||!feedback}}" bindtap="sendFeedback">提交反馈</button><view wx:if="{{feedbackId}}" class="feedback-receipt">已记下你的建议，编号：{{feedbackId}}</view></view><view class="card account-removal"><view class="section-title">账号与个人记录</view><view wx:if="{{deletionStatus==='pending'||deletionStatus==='running'}}" class="note">账号已停用，个人记录正在分批删除。<button class="secondary" bindtap="status">刷新删除进度</button></view><view wx:elif="{{deletionStatus==='completed'}}" class="muted">个人记录清理已完成。</view><block wx:else><view class="muted">注销前，请先导出需要的数据，并转让或关闭自己管理的厨房。共享菜谱随厨房保留。</view><button class="text-danger" bindtap="remove" disabled="{{busy}}">注销账号并删除个人记录</button></block></view></view>
